                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Our communities in rural areas deserve the best access to care.\n\nThat\u2019s why last week, I introduced the bipartisan Keep Physicians Serving Patients Act.\n\nThis bill will keep rural doctor pay competitive so doctors can serve patients in the areas that need them the most.",
