                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We must support our elders!  \n\nProject 2025 would impose \u201climits or lifetime caps on Medicaid benefits.\u201d  \n\n184,900 Medicaid enrollees in NM could lose coverage because they are low income & lack access to alternative, affordable coverage.  \n\nThey deserve better!",
