                "text": "Trump\u2019s big abomination of a bill could cripple the Medicaid payment system in NM with the almost $1 trillion in cuts to Medicaid funding nationwide.\n\nMedicaid is the largest source of healthcare in NM, and the loss of federal matching dollars could mean the loss of coverage for thousands of families, decreased coverage and providers, and the closure of hospitals and clinics across our state.\n\nOur families will suffer for no other reasons than Trump and the GOP want to give their ultra-wealthy friends and corporations permanent tax breaks and kickbacks.",
